title=The+Fractured+Factions+of+the+Warpstorm&slug=chaotic-factions&content=%3Ch1%3EThe+Fractured+Factions+of+the+Warpstorm%3C%2Fh1%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EShort+answer%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Three+powers+fight+for+the+storm%27s+edge%3A+the+%3Cstrong%3EIndustrial+Zealots%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%28machine-worshipping+forges%29%2C+the+%3Cstrong%3EVoid+Nomads%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%28stateless+storm-riders%29+and+the+%3Cstrong%3ECorrupt+Cults%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%28chaos-mystics+seeking+revelation+in+broken+physics%29.+Each+faction+has+its+own+ideology%2C+colours+and+aesthetic+%E2%80%94+and+each+is+playable+as+a+miniature+force%2C+kitbash+or+paint+project.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EWarpstorm+is+an+original+fictional+universe.+Not+affiliated+with+any+other+sci-fi+franchise+or+games+company.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EA+Rift+Where+Empires+End%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EThe+settled+systems+send+armadas.+The+storm+eats+them.+What+remains+around+the+Warpstorm%27s+edge+is+not+one+power+but+three+%E2%80%94+each+born+from+a+different+answer+to+the+same+question%3A+%3Cem%3Ewhat+do+you+do+when+the+universe+stops+making+sense%3F%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EThe+Industrial+Zealots%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EIdeology%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+The+storm+is+a+gift.+Its+unstable+energy+powers+smelting+furnaces+no+ordinary+reactor+could+feed%2C+and+the+Zealots+have+built+their+entire+civilization+around+harvesting+it.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ELook%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Massive+forge-shrines%2C+riveted+armour%2C+copper+and+black+iron%2C+exhaust-stacks+like+cathedral+spires%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPalette%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+oxidized+copper%2C+soot+black%2C+ember+orange%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EOn+the+table%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+slow%2C+brutal%2C+armour-heavy+forces+built+around+a+central+engine-shrine%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPaint+guide+match%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Frust-and-battle-damage%2F%22%3Erust+and+battle+damage%3C%2Fa%3E+is+their+entire+aesthetic%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cp%3EThe+Zealots+believe+every+storm+flare+is+a+sermon+and+every+lost+ship+an+offering.+Their+forges+have+never+gone+cold.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EThe+Void+Nomads%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EIdeology%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Freedom+is+distance.+The+Nomads+learned+to+ride+the+storm%27s+energy+waves+%E2%80%94+sailing+its+edge+currents+to+stay+beyond+every+law%2C+census+and+debt.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ELook%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+patched-together+ships%2C+mismatched+armour%2C+sails+and+antenna+masts%2C+trophies+from+a+hundred+ports%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPalette%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+storm+grey%2C+teal+glow+accents%2C+salt-white%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EOn+the+table%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+fast%2C+raid-focused+forces%3B+every+model+unique%2C+every+vehicle+kitbashed%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPaint+guide+match%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Fkitbashing-guide%2F%22%3Ekitbashing+guide%3C%2Fa%3E+%E2%80%94+a+Nomad+army+is+%3Cem%3Ebuilt%3C%2Fem%3E+to+be+one-of-a-kind%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cp%3ETheir+fleets+appear+without+warning%2C+trade+at+honest+prices+in+stolen+goods%2C+and+vanish+before+the+bill+arrives.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EThe+Corrupt+Cults%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EIdeology%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+The+storm+is+a+door.+What+speaks+through+it+is+worth+more+than+safety%2C+worth+more+than+sanity+%E2%80%94+and+the+Cults+have+been+listening+for+a+very+long+time.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ELook%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+ritual-glowing+relics+fused+with+salvaged+tech%2C+robed+figures%2C+asymmetrical+mutation+of+form%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPalette%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+violet+portal-light%2C+abyssal+black%2C+bone%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EOn+the+table%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+unpredictable%2C+trick-heavy+forces+centred+on+relics+and+portals%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPaint+guide+match%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Fobject-source-lighting%2F%22%3EOSL+guide%3C%2Fa%3E+%E2%80%94+nothing+says+Cult+like+a+glowing+relic+at+the+wrong+moment%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cp%3ETheir+knowledge+is+real%2C+their+miracles+are+real%2C+and+their+price+is+never+money.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EWhich+Faction+Will+You+Paint%3F%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cfigure+class%3D%22wp-block-table%22%3E%3Ctable%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%3EYou+like...%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EYour+faction%3C%2Fth%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Fthead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EHeavy+industry%2C+rust%2C+smoke%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3E%3Cstrong%3EIndustrial+Zealots%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EPatchwork+ships%2C+freedom%2C+fast+builds%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3E%3Cstrong%3EVoid+Nomads%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EGlow%2C+ritual%2C+horror+and+mystery%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3E%3Cstrong%3ECorrupt+Cults%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Ftbody%3E%3C%2Ftable%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EContinue+Reading%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Flore%2Fwhat-is-the-warpstorm%2F%22%3EWhat+Is+the+Warpstorm%3F%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+the+universe%27s+starting+point%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Flore%2Fwarp-travel-explained%2F%22%3EWarp+Travel+Explained%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+the+routes+the+factions+fight+over%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Flore%2Flost-expedition-stories%2F%22%3E7+Lost+Expeditions+Into+the+Warpstorm%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+where+the+factions+meet+their+end%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Feasy-weathering-techniques%2F%22%3EEasy+Weathering+Techniques%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+every+faction+wears+grime%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EThree+answers+to+one+impossible+storm.+Pick+yours+%E2%80%94+then+paint+it.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E&status=publish